menu "Metrics Configuration"

    config METRICS_ENABLE
        bool "Enable metrics emission over serial"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, emits structured JSON metric lines prefixed with ##M##
            to UART0. Disable to compile out all instrumentation.

    config METRICS_DEVICE_ID
        string "Device ID string"
        default "esp32-A"
        depends on METRICS_ENABLE
        help
            Short identifier embedded in every metric line as the "dev" field.
            Use distinct IDs when running two boards simultaneously.

endmenu
